WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.569 --> 00:00:06.673
♪ ♪

00:00:06.674 --> 00:00:07.019
♪ ♪

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:08.370
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BECAUSE ABSOLUTELY

00:00:08.405 --> 00:00:09.863
ANYTHING IS POSSIBLE IN THE YEAR

00:00:09.865 --> 00:00:11.451
2020, THE GOVERNOR OF NEW YORK

00:00:11.486 --> 00:00:13.340
ANDREW CUOMO IS COMING OUT WITH

00:00:13.342 --> 00:00:15.513
THE NEW BOOK "BRAGGING" ABOUT

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:17.062
HOW HE RESPONDED TO THE

00:00:17.063 --> 00:00:17.482
CORONAVIRUS.

00:00:17.516 --> 00:00:19.697
JOINING US NOW IS JANICE DEAN, A

00:00:19.698 --> 00:00:20.489
SENIOR METEOROLOGIST HERE AT

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:21.926
FOX NEWS.

00:00:21.928 --> 00:00:23.475
SADLY, HER IN-LAWS DIED IN

00:00:23.509 --> 00:00:26.014
NURSING HOMES IN NEW YORK STATE

00:00:26.048 --> 00:00:27.333
BECAUSE OF THE POLICIES

00:00:27.368 --> 00:00:28.398
ANDREW CUOMO BACK.

00:00:28.432 --> 00:00:29.736
WE SHOULD ALSO SAY JANICE DEAN

00:00:29.737 --> 00:00:31.467
IS ONE OF THE MOST HONEST PEOPLE

00:00:31.468 --> 00:00:32.633
WE KNOW AND THEREFORE ONE OF OUR

00:00:32.634 --> 00:00:33.133
FAVORITE GUESTS.

00:00:33.134 --> 00:00:34.201
THANKS FOR COMING ON.

00:00:34.202 --> 00:00:36.863
I’M GOING TO THROW IT TO YOU,

00:00:36.865 --> 00:00:38.194
WHAT IS YOUR RESPONSE TO THIS

00:00:38.195 --> 00:00:38.493
BOOK?

00:00:38.494 --> 00:00:40.266
&gt;&gt; I COULDN’T BELIEVE IT WHEN I

00:00:40.301 --> 00:00:42.209
FOUND OUT JUST A COUPLE OF

00:00:42.211 --> 00:00:44.396
MONTHS AGO THAT HE HAD TIME TO

00:00:44.397 --> 00:00:45.917
WRITE A BOOK IN THE MIDDLE OF A

00:00:45.952 --> 00:00:46.575
PANDEMIC.

00:00:46.577 --> 00:00:48.581
I MEAN, WHAT GOVERNOR WOULD HAVE

00:00:48.582 --> 00:00:50.210
TIME TO DO THAT?

00:00:50.211 --> 00:00:51.307
IT’S INCREDIBLE.

00:00:51.308 --> 00:00:54.357
I ACTUALLY THOUGHT IT WAS A

00:00:54.392 --> 00:00:58.092
SATIRE WHEN I SAW HE WAS WRITING

00:00:58.127 --> 00:01:00.394
A BOOK ABOUT HIS LEADERSHIP,

00:01:00.395 --> 00:01:02.107
TAKING A VICTORY LAB FOR

00:01:02.108 --> 00:01:04.599
PLANNING THE CURVE, THE CURVE

00:01:04.633 --> 00:01:06.981
THAT HAS MY IN LAWS ON IT.

00:01:07.015 --> 00:01:08.173
HE HAS LOST MORE PEOPLE IN

00:01:08.207 --> 00:01:10.054
NEW YORK FROM CORONAVIRUS ON HIS

00:01:10.088 --> 00:01:12.990
WATCH THAN ANY OTHER STATE.

00:01:12.991 --> 00:01:15.027
OVER THE 300,000 PEOPLE HAVE

00:01:15.029 --> 00:01:15.913
DIED, INCLUDING MY IN-LAWS.

00:01:15.914 --> 00:01:18.633
WE STILL DON’T HAVE THE ACTUAL

00:01:18.667 --> 00:01:20.844
TOTAL NUMBER OF DEATHS FROM

00:01:20.878 --> 00:01:22.214
SENIORS GETTING COVID AND THEIR

00:01:22.216 --> 00:01:25.749
ASSISTANT LIVING FACILITIES OR

00:01:25.784 --> 00:01:27.453
THEIR ELDERCARE FACILITIES

00:01:27.454 --> 00:01:29.808
BECAUSE HIS NURSING HOME

00:01:29.809 --> 00:01:30.726
REPRESENTATIVE, HIS HEALTH

00:01:30.728 --> 00:01:33.706
COMMISSIONER WILL NOT GIVE US

00:01:33.707 --> 00:01:36.389
THE ACCURATE TOTALS OF THOSE

00:01:36.390 --> 00:01:38.829
THAT DIED IN HOSPITALS, LIKE MY

00:01:38.864 --> 00:01:39.120
MOTHER-IN-LAW.

00:01:39.154 --> 00:01:41.091
THERE’S ALL THESE UNANSWERED

00:01:41.125 --> 00:01:44.052
QUESTIONS THAT WE HAVE ABOUT HIS

00:01:44.053 --> 00:01:47.268
LEADERSHIP THAT HE HAS NOT

00:01:47.269 --> 00:01:49.274
ANSWERED IN HIS SO-CALLED BOOK.

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:50.763
&gt;&gt; Tucker: DID YOU EXPECT HIM

00:01:50.764 --> 00:01:52.087
TO APOLOGIZE?

00:01:52.088 --> 00:01:55.165
SINCE YOUR QUESTION.

00:01:55.167 --> 00:01:57.139
&gt;&gt; I’M NOT SURE.

00:01:57.140 --> 00:01:59.060
UP UNTIL THIS POINT, HE HASN’T

00:01:59.061 --> 00:01:59.717
APOLOGIZED.

00:01:59.718 --> 00:02:01.710
I THINK IN THE VERY BEGINNING,

00:02:01.745 --> 00:02:02.920
TUCKER, IF HE HAD TAKEN SOME

00:02:02.921 --> 00:02:04.882
ACCOUNTABILITY AND THAT I WAS

00:02:04.917 --> 00:02:06.878
TRYING TO SAVE SOME OF THE

00:02:06.879 --> 00:02:08.836
HOSPITAL BEDS FOR THE PATIENTS

00:02:08.871 --> 00:02:11.142
THAT WE NEEDED, AND THAT’S WHY I

00:02:11.177 --> 00:02:12.422
MADE THAT MISTAKE OF PUTTING

00:02:12.456 --> 00:02:13.744
COVID POSITIVE PATIENTS INTO

00:02:13.745 --> 00:02:14.908
NURSING HOMES FOR 46 DAYS, BY

00:02:14.943 --> 00:02:15.352
THE WAY.

00:02:15.385 --> 00:02:16.700
IF HE HAD DONE THAT IN THE VERY

00:02:16.734 --> 00:02:18.804
BEGINNING BUT HE NEVER HAS AND

00:02:18.806 --> 00:02:21.137
BY THE WAY, HE’S BLAMED EVERYONE

00:02:21.139 --> 00:02:22.761
ELSE EXCEPT THE PERSON THAT

00:02:22.762 --> 00:02:23.628
SIGNED THE EXECUTIVE ORDER,

00:02:23.629 --> 00:02:24.435
ANDREW CUOMO.

00:02:24.436 --> 00:02:26.794
IT WAS IN EFFECT FOR 46 DAYS.

00:02:26.828 --> 00:02:28.610
HE IS BLAMED GOD AND

00:02:28.644 --> 00:02:30.354
MOTHER NATURE AND THE PRESIDENT

00:02:30.388 --> 00:02:31.502
AND THE CDC AND

00:02:31.536 --> 00:02:32.525
"THE NEW YORK POST" AND

00:02:32.527 --> 00:02:33.922
FOX NEWS, HE BLAMED EVERYONE
EXCEPT THE PERSON THAT SIGNED

00:02:33.923 --> 00:02:37.000
EXCEPT THE PERSON THAT SIGNED

00:02:37.035 --> 00:02:44.780
THE MANDATE, THE ORDER PUTTING

00:02:44.781 --> 00:02:47.997
THOSE COVID POSITIVE PATIENTS

00:02:48.031 --> 00:02:49.034
INTO NURSING HOMES.

00:02:49.035 --> 00:02:50.065
THAT’S WHAT GETS MY BLOOD

00:02:50.099 --> 00:02:50.305
BOILING.

00:02:50.339 --> 00:02:51.157
HE STILL REFUSES TO ACKNOWLEDGE

00:02:51.158 --> 00:02:51.338
THAT.

00:02:51.339 --> 00:02:52.263
THE OTHER DAY IN AN INTERVIEW HE

00:02:52.297 --> 00:02:53.071
ACTUALLY SAID WE DIDN’T NEED TO

00:02:53.106 --> 00:02:53.796
PUT COVID POSITIVE PATIENTS INTO

00:02:53.797 --> 00:02:54.396
NURSING HOMES AND I SCREAMED.

00:02:54.430 --> 00:02:55.094
IT JUST MAKES OUR GRIEF EVEN

00:02:55.128 --> 00:02:55.442
WORSE, TUCKER.

00:02:55.476 --> 00:02:56.110
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I COULDN’T AGREE

00:02:56.111 --> 00:02:56.444
MORE.

00:02:56.478 --> 00:02:59.125
WE’VE MADE MISTAKES ON THIS SHOW

00:02:59.126 --> 00:03:01.018
BUT YOU KNOW A MAN’S CHARACTER

00:03:01.019 --> 00:03:02.043
BY THEIR REACTION NEXT.

00:03:02.044 --> 00:03:04.136
PEOPLE WHO BLAME OTHERS AND

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:05.275
DON’T APOLOGIZE FOR THEIR

00:03:05.276 --> 00:03:06.518
MISTAKES, IT’S JUST THE LOWEST

00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:07.656
AND I’M SORRY YOU HAD TO SUFFER

